{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30972","headline":"河出荣光 · 张良器","name":"河出荣光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"引派崑山峻，朝宗海路长。\n千龄逢圣主，五色瑞荣光。\n隐暎浮中国，晶明助太阳。\n坤维连浩漫，天汉接微茫。\n丹阙清氛里，函关紫气旁。\n位尊常守伯，道泰每呈祥。\n习坎灵逾久，居卑德有常。\n龙门如可涉，忠信是舟梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张良器","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}